WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.253
Watch and read: Ama asks: In a story Ama visits the school with a book. Which is the

00:00:05.253 --> 00:00:05.533
setting?

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:10.100
The answer is: school. The setting is where a story takes place.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:15.393
Watch and read: Ama asks: You read that Ama carries a book to the school. Which fact

00:00:15.393 --> 00:00:16.177
can you share?

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:21.001
The answer is: Ama carries a book.. Share facts stated in the text.
